     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div>Dear all,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nthis may be interesting for some.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nBest regards  ---- Marc<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div lang=\"DE-CH\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span> </span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<b><span lang=\"DE\">Von:</span></b><span lang=\"DE\"> Lluís Brotons &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">l.br...@creaf.uab.cat</a>&gt;\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Gesendet:</b> Dienstag, 29. August 2023 14:41<br>\r\n<b>An:</b> Lluís Brotons &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">l.br...@creaf.uab.cat</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Betreff:</b> THREE </span><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif\">⁦</span><span lang=\"DE\">New Postdoc positions CREAF/Barcelona on forest/landscape and biodiversity spatial modelling (closing Sept 10-11th)</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;border:1pt solid black;padding:0cm;color:rgb(15,20,25)\">To whom in may be interested, please feel free to redistribute:</span></span>\r\n</p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12.0pt\">\r\n </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,20,25)\">THREE\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,20,25)\">⁦</span><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,20,25)\">Postdoc positions on spatial ecology at\r\n</span><a href=\"https://twitter.com/CREAF_ecologia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.com/CREAF_ecologia&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448779953000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0oOZ27IVb7usjs6bRHJBHQ\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt\">@CREAF_ecologia</span></a><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,20,25)\"> \r\n !</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12.0pt\">\r\n </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;border:1pt solid black;padding:0cm;color:rgb(15,20,25)\">One experienced spatial modeller researcher with a strong background in Bird SDMs to work in the\r\n</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;border:1pt solid black;padding:0cm;color:rgb(15,20,25)\">⁦</span></span>\r\n</p>\r\n<div style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-flex;min-height:0px;min-width:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,20,25)\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/SPEAR_biodiv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.com/SPEAR_biodiv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448779953000&amp;usg=AOvVaw237miH0xfac3eOaTtHM7vG\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;border:1pt solid black;padding:0cm;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(29,155,240)\">@SPEAR_biodiv</span></a>\r\n</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;border:1pt solid black;padding:0cm;color:rgb(15,20,25)\">project (Scenarios for Protecting European Avian Redistributions ).\r\n</span></span><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,20,25)\"></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,20,25)\"><a href=\"https://www.creaf.cat/ca/node/21349\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.creaf.cat/ca/node/21349&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448779953000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1u6bOkgC8uRq9K4PoiWHke\">https://www.creaf.cat/ca/node/21349</a></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,20,25)\">Closes September 10th</span></b></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12.0pt\">\r\n </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quo