www.creaf.cat/work-with-us/postdoctoral-researcher-wilde-project-0</a></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12.0pt\">\r\n<span><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;border:1pt solid black;padding:0cm;color:rgb(15,20,25)\"><a href=\"https://www.creaf.cat/work-with-us/postdoctoral-researcher-wilde-project\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.creaf.cat/work-with-us/postdoctoral-researcher-wilde-project&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448779953000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3MceJzOI9KqhzgIhkbhqEO\">https://www.creaf.cat/work-with-us/postdoctoral-researcher-wilde-project</a></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,20,25)\">Close September 11th</span></b></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12.0pt\">\r\n </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12.0pt\">\r\n<span><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;border:1pt solid black;padding:0cm;color:rgb(15,20,25)\">Cheers to all!</span></span><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;border:1pt solid black;padding:0cm;color:rgb(15,20,25)\"><br>\r\n<span>Lluís</span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Lluís Brotons</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-fam